PyDoc_STRVAR(__pyx_doc_14meltygui_imgui_4core_548begin_drag_drop_source, "begin_drag_drop_source(ImGuiDragDropFlags flags=0)\n\nSet the current item as a drag and drop source. If ``dragging`` is True, you\ncan call :func:`set_drag_drop_payload` and :func:`end_drag_drop_source`.\nUse with ``with`` to automatically call :func:`end_drag_drop_source` if necessary.\n\n**Note:** this is a beta API.\n\n.. visual-example::\n    :auto_layout:\n    :width: 300\n\n    with meltygui_imgui.begin(\"Example: drag and drop\"):\n\n        meltygui_imgui.button('source')\n        with meltygui_imgui.begin_drag_drop_source() as drag_drop_src:\n            if drag_drop_src.dragging:\n                meltygui_imgui.set_drag_drop_payload('itemtype', b'payload')\n                meltygui_imgui.button('dragged source')\n\n        meltygui_imgui.button('dest')\n        with meltygui_imgui.begin_drag_drop_target() as drag_drop_dst:\n            if drag_drop_dst.hovered:\n                payload = meltygui_imgui.accept_drag_drop_payload('itemtype')\n                if payload is not None:\n                    print('Received:', payload)\n\nExample::\n\n    meltygui_imgui.begin(\"Example: drag and drop\")\n\n    meltygui_imgui.button('source')\n    if meltygui_imgui.begin_drag_drop_source():\n        meltygui_imgui.set_drag_drop_payload('itemtype', b'payload')\n        meltygui_imgui.button('dragged source')\n        meltygui_imgui.end_drag_drop_source()\n\n    meltygui_imgui.button('dest')\n    if meltygui_imgui.begin_drag_drop_target():\n        payload = meltygui_imgui.accept_drag_drop_payload('itemtype')\n        if payload is not None:\n            print('Received:', payload)\n        meltygui_imgui.end_drag_drop_target()\n\n    meltygui_imgui.end()\n\nArgs:\n    flags (ImGuiDragDropFlags): DragDrop flags.\n\nReturns:\n    _BeginEndDragDropSource: Use ``dragging`` to tell if a drag starting at this source is occurring.\n    Only call :func:`end_drag_drop_source` if ``dragging`` is True.\n    Use with ``with`` to automatically call :func:`end_drag_drop_source` i""f necessary when the block ends.\n\n.. wraps::\n    bool BeginDragDropSource(ImGuiDragDropFlags flags = 0)");
